    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i><strong>We boil at different degrees.&quot; \u2014Ralph Waldo Emerson</strong></i> (writer, USA, 19th cent.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently drags ex-gang leader Dan into a brutal smuggler war in a border town.<br>He\u2019ll pay any price to achieve his goal\u2014and make everyone else pay, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy. No compromise. At any cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9fdc97518fb3fa01bc86b4669cc3b0c8.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9fdc97518fb3fa01bc86b4669cc3b0c8.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the shifting quicksand of narrative and gameplay. Unravel a web of interconnected events that lead Dan down a path he never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cc118ee2cdbc9f66682fd48eecb7a21a.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9d0f3e8193bbd37faf1c0b290613193a.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9d0f3e8193bbd37faf1c0b290613193a.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9d0f3e8193bbd37faf1c0b290613193a.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/1acf444ddddde094688ad74c54045145.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/1acf444ddddde094688ad74c54045145.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/1acf444ddddde094688ad74c54045145.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/c87a4f440a0276669fef4123b6e84fd0.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=7 /></span><strong>Large, dynamic levels</strong> offer tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters\u2014from luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows, slide across furniture, and use the environment to strike fast and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch enemies off guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/c87a4f440a0276669fef4123b6e84fd0.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=7 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a7f4fed9e67e222d7f176b45731608a5.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a7f4fed9e67e222d7f176b45731608a5.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a7f4fed9e67e222d7f176b45731608a5.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/ceb5100af452bd21e7d690fcbf2fdd7a.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/ceb5100af452bd21e7d690fcbf2fdd7a.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/ceb5100af452bd21e7d690fcbf2fdd7a.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/95cbcfe377f064dced067066cae3fbb4.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/0df7260b583880a629c35a4577ca9ab3.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/0df7260b583880a629c35a4577ca9ab3.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/0df7260b583880a629c35a4577ca9ab3.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to spend time talking\u2014or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i><strong>We boil at different degrees.&quot; \u2014Ralph Waldo Emerson</strong></i> (writer, USA, 19th cent.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently drags ex-gang leader Dan into a brutal smuggler war in a border town.<br>He\u2019ll pay any price to achieve his goal\u2014and make everyone else pay, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy. No compromise. At any cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9fdc97518fb3fa01bc86b4669cc3b0c8.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9fdc97518fb3fa01bc86b4669cc3b0c8.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the shifting quicksand of narrative and gameplay. Unravel a web of interconnected events that lead Dan down a path he never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cc118ee2cdbc9f66682fd48eecb7a21a.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9d0f3e8193bbd37faf1c0b290613193a.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9d0f3e8193bbd37faf1c0b290613193a.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/9d0f3e8193bbd37faf1c0b290613193a.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/1acf444ddddde094688ad74c54045145.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/1acf444ddddde094688ad74c54045145.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/1acf444ddddde094688ad74c54045145.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/c87a4f440a0276669fef4123b6e84fd0.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=7 /></span><strong>Large, dynamic levels</strong> offer tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters\u2014from luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows, slide across furniture, and use the environment to strike fast and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch enemies off guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/c87a4f440a0276669fef4123b6e84fd0.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=7 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a7f4fed9e67e222d7f176b45731608a5.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a7f4fed9e67e222d7f176b45731608a5.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a7f4fed9e67e222d7f176b45731608a5.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/ceb5100af452bd21e7d690fcbf2fdd7a.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/ceb5100af452bd21e7d690fcbf2fdd7a.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/ceb5100af452bd21e7d690fcbf2fdd7a.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/95cbcfe377f064dced067066cae3fbb4.webp?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/0df7260b583880a629c35a4577ca9ab3.poster.avif?t=1755244270\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/0df7260b583880a629c35a4577ca9ab3.webm?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/0df7260b583880a629c35a4577ca9ab3.mp4?t=1755244270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to spend time talking\u2014or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>",
